y"],["ARC or PLC in Kenedy County","/arc-plc/texas/kenedy-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids came in under 90% of normal in July to August in 42 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle got 55% of normal in September to October and 54% in October to November. In 2026 so far it got 10% in January to February and 8% in February to March. Grid 7931 had its driest year in 2011 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
